WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.698
It's crazy, San Diego is so crowded during Comic Con,

2
00:00:02.698 --> 00:00:04.949
there isn't a hotel room available anywhere in the city

3
00:00:04.949 --> 00:00:06.524
for miles around.

4
00:00:06.524 --> 00:00:07.429
It's nuts.

5
00:00:07.429 --> 00:00:08.969
Yeah, it's crazy.

6
00:00:08.969 --> 00:00:11.737
And I actually, because space is so tight,

7
00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:15.000
I came up with a way to make a little money while I'm here.

8
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.446
Seriously, Andy, I'm just curious, what's that?

9
00:00:18.446 --> 00:00:20.771
Well, I'm Airbnb-ing my lectern.

10
00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:23.604
(audience cheers)

11
00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:31.320
Say hi to Hans everybody.

12
00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:32.228
[Hans] Hey.

13
00:00:32.228 --> 00:00:33.478
Say hi, Hans.

14
00:00:35.738 --> 00:00:36.687
His name's Hans, huh?

15
00:00:36.687 --> 00:00:38.572
Yeah, yeah, it's Hans down there.

16
00:00:38.572 --> 00:00:39.485
So, I'm curious.

17
00:00:39.485 --> 00:00:40.596
How are you doing there, Hans?

18
00:00:40.596 --> 00:00:41.752
[Hans] I can't feel my legs.

19
00:00:41.752 --> 00:00:42.721
Okay, that's fine.

20
00:00:42.721 --> 00:00:43.823
Okay, okay.

21
00:00:43.823 --> 00:00:44.953
That's fine, leave it alone.

22
00:00:44.953 --> 00:00:47.333
No, you're just, you be quiet for the next hour

23
00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:48.465
down there Hans.

24
00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:50.782
(audience claps)

25
00:00:50.782 --> 00:00:51.713
He'll probably pass out soon.

26
00:00:51.713 --> 00:00:52.546
Yeah.

